# Local values for `wrangler dev` (FR-13.4). Copy to .dev.vars, which is
# gitignored and must never be committed.
#
#   cp apps/worker/.dev.vars.example apps/worker/.dev.vars
#
# In production the key is a Worker secret instead:
#   npx wrangler secret put GEMINI_API_KEY
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the model id without a code change.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash
